。"},{"id":"c-songshu-084-xietiao-kong:p001:u0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"邈","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"父名邈，官揚州治中。宋64元嘉三年巡行揚州的同名人官司徒左西掾，兩傳未互指。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":125,"last_line":125,"revision_id":2068534,"source_layer":"received_biography","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true,"raw_start":14195,"raw_end":14222,"raw_character_offsets":[14195,14196,14197,14198,14199,14200,14201,14202,14203,14204,14205,14206,14207,14208,14209,14210,14211,14212,14213,14214,14215,14216,14217,14218,14219,14220,14221],"projection_sha256":"dd0419e192cc098fa379d1f5166ff5d68931ef71aca057e980075e7b803de3d5"},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-084-xietiao-kong","book_id":"b-songshu-084","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-084-xietiao-kong-ws2068534"},{"id":"c-songshu-084-xietiao-kong:p002","text":"轉署記室，奉牋固辭，曰：「記室之局，實惟華要，自非文行秀敏，莫或居之。覬遜業之舉，無聞於鄉部；惰遊之貶，有編於疲農。直山淵藏引，用不遐棄，故得抃風儛潤，憑附彌年。今日之命，非所敢冒。昔之學優藝富，猶尚斯難，況覬能薄質魯","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-084-xietiao-kong:p002:m0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"覬","person_id":"vjg_m4c_ev5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本句具名，按上下文讀作孔覬〔宋，字思遠〕。"},{"id":"c-songshu-084-xietiao-kong:p002:m0104","start":104,"end":105,"surface":"覬","person_id":"vjg_m4c_ev5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本句具名，按上下文讀作孔覬〔宋，字思遠〕。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":127,"last_line":127,"revision_id":2068534,"source_layer":"received_biography","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true,"raw_start":14293,"raw_end":14402,"raw_character_offsets":[14293,14294,14295,14296,14297,14298,14299,14300,14301,14302,14303,14304,14305,14306,14307,14308,14309,14310,14311,14312,14313,14314,14315,14316,14317,14318,14319,14320,14321,14322,14323,14324,14325,14326,14327,14328,14329,14330,14331,14332,14333,14334,14335,14336,14337,14338,14339,14340,14341,14342,14343,14344,14345,14346,14347,143